	IF:	ChatCapture {(^(\[[A-z]+?\] |)You|.*\<Tell:IIDString:.+:(Gvbz)\>.+\<\\Tell\>) (say|says|tells you), \"mule\"$} {} ~~ if you recieve /tell "mule" from main character, it will start the muling sequence. Make sure to change the main character name ~~
		DO:	DoAll
				SetState {Muling_Sequence}
