STATE: {Muling_Sequence}
	IF:	Expr {listcount[wobjectfindalllandscapebynamerx[`^Garmor$`]] > 0 && coordinatedistancewithz[getplayercoordinates[], wobjectgetphysicscoordinates[listgetitem[wobjectfindalllandscapebynamerx[`^Garmor$`], 0]]] < 20} ~~ Check if Garmor is within range. Make sure to change each mules name so it is applicable to your account ~~
		DO:	DoAll ~~ Garmor branch: transfer armor items from primary mule to secondary mule, then have the secondary mule autopack and log out. ~~
				Chat {/ub bct "armor_mule" 20000 /ub follow Gmule} ~~ command to auto follow primary mule, this will turn on nav, but not vtank ~~
				Chat {/ub bct "armor_mule" 20000 /vt start} ~~ turns on vtank for the secondary mule ~~
				Chat {/ub delay 35000 /ub ig armor_mule.utl to Garmor} ~~ Transfers armor items from primary mule to secondary mule based on a loot profile ~~
				Chat {/ub bct "armor_mule" 45000 /mt autopack} ~~ autopacks secondary mule after 45 second delay ~~
				Chat {/ub bct "armor_mule" 50000 /mf lnc set Gcloths} ~~ sets the next secondary mule in the chain to Gcloths, dont forget to change names ~~
				Chat {/ub bct "armor_mule" 60000 /vt stop} ~~ turns off vtank for next login ~~
				Chat {/ub bct "armor_mule" 60000 /vt opt set EnableNav false} ~~ disables nav for next login ~~
				Chat {/ub bct "armor_mule" 60000 /mt logout} ~~ logs secondary muleout after a 60 second delay ~~
	IF:	Expr {listcount[wobjectfindalllandscapebynamerx[`^Gcloths$`]] > 0 && coordinatedistancewithz[getplayercoordinates[], wobjectgetphysicscoordinates[listgetitem[wobjectfindalllandscapebynamerx[`^Gcloths$`], 0]]] < 20}
