	IF:	Expr {listcount[wobjectfindalllandscapebynamerx[`^Grare$`]] > 0 && coordinatedistancewithz[getplayercoordinates[], wobjectgetphysicscoordinates[listgetitem[wobjectfindalllandscapebynamerx[`^Grare$`], 0]]] < 20}
		DO:	DoAll
