	IF:	SecsInStateGE 900 ~~ If the Muling_Sequence state has been active for 15 minutes, something is wrong. Clear the login queue, reset secondary mule to Garmor and logout, effectively resetting the meta ~~
		DO:	DoAll
				SetState {Reset}
~~ }
STATE: {Reset}
	IF:	SecsInStateGE 15 ~~ If the Reset state has been active for 30 seconds. Clear the login queue, reset secondary mule to Garmor and logout, effectively resetting the meta ~~
		DO:	DoAll
				Chat {/ub bct "three" /mf lnc set Garmor} ~~ resets the next secondary mule in the chain to Garmor using common network tag "three", this sends the command to every secondary mule in the chain. Make sure each character has the utility belt network tags set correctly~~
				Chat {/ub bct "three" /mt logout}
				SetState {Default}
